sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant D as DNS resolver
  participant S as Server :443
  C->>D: A? shop.example.com
  D-->>C: 203.0.113.10 (TTL 300)
  C->>S: TCP SYN
  S-->>C: SYN-ACK
  C->>S: ACK + TLS ClientHello (key share)
  S-->>C: ServerHello, certificate, Finished
  C->>S: Finished + GET /cart
  S-->>C: 200 OK
  Note over C,S: later requests reuse the connection: 1 round trip each
